#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:1 905aaa37c3054005b67d05a343743e97
msgid "筛选栏：按标签、元素和表达式找结构"
msgstr "Filter bar: find structures by tags, elements, and expressions"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:3 de9580f30ea94249835f3e578c5cd849
#
msgid ""
"这一页对应结构筛选栏。简单条件优先使用配置类型、化学式和元素筛选；需要组合数值条件时， 再使用 "
"`表达式`。筛选只改变匹配或选择状态，不会自动删除结构。"
msgstr "This page covers the structure filter bar. Use configuration type, formula, and element filters for simple conditions; use `expression` when numeric conditions must be combined. Filtering changes the match or selection state only; it never deletes structures automatically."

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:5 07d3d408f913423f8f9d8695f4a6e51c
msgid "本页目录"
msgstr "On this page"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10684
#: cd5d326e84a14280a146fbb341574089
msgid "6. 结构筛选栏"
msgstr "6. Structure filter bar"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10686
#: b345a7302d98499fadca61403aeb22b4
msgid "结构筛选栏可以同时使用配置类型、化学式、元素、原子条件和自定义表达式。条件默认取交集；经常重复使用的组合可以保存为“常用筛选”。"
msgstr ""
"The filter bar can combine configuration type, formula, element, atomic "
"condition, and custom-expression filters. Conditions are intersected by "
"default; combinations used often can be saved as “saved filters”."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10688
#: 3b5e447a158448ccb998d6f0bb00bf65
msgid "![结构筛选栏与条件编辑器](../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter.png)"
msgstr ""
