#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10690
#: d49b8e0d060341518b46a0b84235bb1f
msgid "6.1 基本流程"
msgstr "6.1 Basic workflow"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10692
#: 22b689fa93ef41d792b4f1426cc02ece
msgid "点击“筛选条件”打开编辑器。空筛选会自动出现第一行。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Filter conditions` to open the editor. An empty filter "
"automatically starts with the first row."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10693
#: ade75cb160094e7cbcfcbfbf90ea0767
msgid "在左下角点击“+”继续添加条件，例如“配置类型包含 `surface`”“必须包含 `Fe,O`”“不得包含 `H`”。"
msgstr ""
"Click `+` in the lower-left corner to add conditions, such as "
"`configuration type contains surface`, `must contain Fe,O`, or `must not "
"contain H`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10694
#: eaeb34e89665472abbe9ea518d709923
msgid "在右上角选择“满足全部条件（AND）”或“满足任一条件（OR）”。"
msgstr ""
"In the upper-right corner, choose whether all conditions (AND) or any "
"condition (OR) must match."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10695
#: 1579eab9b09d4c489660f49cd0315145
msgid "点击“完成并预览”。图中的匹配高亮只用于预览，不会改变当前选择。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Finish and preview`. Highlighted matches are for preview only and "
"do not change the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10696
#: 72241146d8ea441f81c5ced8ba66dc95
msgid "确认匹配数量后，在“应用结果”中选择“替换当前选择”“加入当前选择”或“从当前选择中移除”。"
msgstr ""
"After checking the match count, use `Apply result` to replace the current"
" selection, add to it, or remove matches from it."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10698
#: 9237c8cefef2445e99dcfe86d5112114
msgid "修改条件后，旧匹配结果会显示为“结果已过期”。重新预览前不能继续应用旧结果。"
msgstr ""
"After a condition changes, the previous matches are marked `Result out of"
" date`. You cannot apply the stale result until you preview again."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10700
#: 10ff096a10b243e5b0da7b665e124110
msgid "编辑器右下角的垃圾篓按钮只清空筛选条件和匹配高亮，**不会清空当前选择**。清空选择位于“应用结果”菜单中。"
msgstr ""
"The trash button in the lower-right corner clears only the filter "
"conditions and match highlights; it **does not clear the current "
"selection**. To clear the selection, use the `Apply result` menu."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10702
#: f4aa304a67ab4dbe928ec9713922a10f
msgid "6.2 条件含义"
msgstr "6.2 Condition semantics"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: fbb4466907194e3d898f415eb9541254
msgid "条件"
msgstr "Condition"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 1a898af0edc3413aafe83d011488108e 6c0ffc6c37164a8cbe982ad2ecf04d11
#: bd3b1bce4dba42d1844caac71a9c292f
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 357db941208d4733948945046bbc6a7c 402361515f544c9aa7bdc8bfaa81b1cc
msgid "示例"
msgstr "Examples"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 1fb91a4b43404c24a1758cbabf21b9d4
msgid "配置类型"
msgstr "Configuration type"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 450089d0cdf84f29865c3589e630881c
msgid "包含、完全等于、开头、结尾或正则匹配"
msgstr ""
"Contains, exactly equals, starts with, ends with, or matches a regular "
"expression"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: c66cd69809164793a275a8de3f9b76ae
msgid "`surface`"
msgstr "`surface`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: dcf83143dd9248dc82a843adf433b56e
msgid "化学式"
msgstr "Formula"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 77c7e76bf1ed490f99e551665317bce8
msgid "默认完全等于，也可选择包含或正则匹配"
msgstr ""
"Exactly equals by default; contains and regular-expression matching are "
"also available"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: b24ff24c9b4947e1bf6173c19e066187
msgid "`Fe2O3`"
msgstr "`Fe2O3`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 58be8b44d4704802bdce020b31e1ff28
msgid "必须包含元素"
msgstr "Required elements"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 8e8aa25a2f9a49b4b9c129038af1839d
msgid "所列元素必须全部存在，允许还有其他元素"
msgstr "Every listed element must be present; additional elements are allowed"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: f1e9cc6c55014d30ae6f0927ca846223
msgid "`Fe,O` 可匹配 FeO 和 FeOC"
msgstr "`Fe,O` matches both FeO and FeOC"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 2fe5cf451cc64fb5b9ce22979cfb925c
msgid "不得包含元素"
msgstr "Forbidden elements"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 1ce52898642546688ed7b170e4203f3e
msgid "所列元素必须全部不存在"
msgstr "None of the listed elements may be present"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: c999760ef75242ba987246d8db694ac4
msgid "`H` 排除含 H 结构"
msgstr "`H` excludes structures containing H"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: faae352c7a1b4f0d9be5c5eed29abefd
msgid "只允许这些元素"
msgstr "Allowed elements only"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 0d85fdc193cf467d94761e46eb4939ca
msgid "结构中不能出现列表外元素"
msgstr "The structure may not contain elements outside the list"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: ab5b13eb403542b6869024a05f2131dc
msgid "`Fe,O` 可匹配 Fe、O 和 FeO"
msgstr "`Fe,O` matches Fe, O, and FeO structures"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: bbbcf6603e8c4921b42296196421c901
msgid "自定义表达式"
msgstr "Custom expression"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 76f8baa5ada54f6c87e20173c2cc7cea
msgid "使用现有结构表达式引擎"
msgstr "Use the existing structure-expression engine"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10787
#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10957
#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 83421be7b4f44af7b271ad6d70023d32 b4f3618e3d154ae18716770233a40e76
#: c6efa431272c4d7688bd68ea757e6a00
msgid "`natoms > 100`"
msgstr "`natoms > 100`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 47da80880950452b9e2b3d681ff1031f
msgid "原子条件"
msgstr "Atomic condition"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 5931834fd7da4d2ea637435aa397e007
msgid "选择目标元素、任一/所有原子、性质、比较符和阈值"
msgstr "Choose an element, any/all atoms, property, comparison, and threshold"

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-filter.md:11
#: 8d94f8209c7d4171966d0bb377c7c63e
msgid "任一 Fe 原子的磁矩模长小于 1"
msgstr "Any Fe atom has a magnetic moment magnitude below 1"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10714
#: 61e99130782e47dc8ca066d57ad10098
msgid "同一条配置类型或化学式条件可以用分号输入多个值，多个值之间取“任一匹配”。元素之间使用逗号或空格分隔，例如 `Fe, O`。"
msgstr ""
"A configuration-type or formula condition can contain multiple values "
"separated by semicolons; any one may match. Separate elements with commas"
" or spaces, for example `Fe, O`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10716
#: e65d4dcb7ada43cab07e725ceee91155
msgid "每行左侧的开关控制该条件是否参与筛选。关闭条件不会删除输入内容。配置类型和化学式右侧的 `Aa` 控制是否区分大小写；高亮时区分，未高亮时不区分。"
msgstr ""
"The switch on the left of each row controls whether that condition "
"participates in filtering. Disabling a condition preserves its input. For"
" configuration type and formula, the `Aa` button controls case "
"sensitivity: highlighted means case-sensitive; otherwise matching ignores"
" case."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10718
#: ea6339c32cc944f5addc5620d151b1df
msgid "非法正则、未知元素或错误表达式会直接标记对应条件，不会被当成“0 个匹配”，也不会意外匹配全部结构。"
msgstr ""
"An invalid regular expression, unknown element, or malformed expression "
"marks the corresponding condition as invalid. It is neither treated as "
"zero matches nor allowed to match every structure accidentally."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10720
#: 11b259d7ac1f4a55af7412b9d871100b
msgid "不写表达式，筛选某种元素的磁矩"
msgstr "Filter element-specific magnetic moments without typing an expression"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10722
#: 9e0a2357dd4a4efeab14a6da1182fafd
msgid ""
"在条件类型中选择“原子条件”，将“目标元素”设为 `Fe`，“满足方式”设为“任一目标原子满足”，“原子性质”选“磁矩 · "
"模长”，比较选“小于”，阈值输入 `1`。此时只要一个 Fe 原子的磁矩模长小于 1，结构就会匹配；其他元素的小磁矩不会造成误匹配。"
msgstr ""
"Choose Atomic condition, set Target element to Fe, Match to At least one "
"atom, Property to Magnetic moment · Magnitude, Comparison to Less than, "
"and Threshold to 1. A structure matches if at least one Fe atom has a "
"moment magnitude below 1; small moments on other elements do not produce "
"a match."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10724
#: ff7ae208c1eb45699ba758ee522798cc
msgid ""
"若要求所有 Fe 原子都满足，直接把“满足方式”切换为“所有目标原子满足”。两种方式均排除不含 Fe "
"的结构。选择“全部元素”时，对结构中的全部原子判断。"
msgstr ""
"To require every Fe atom to satisfy the condition, choose All target "
"atoms. Both modes exclude structures without Fe. All elements evaluates "
"the condition across every atom in the structure."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10726
#: 5be9064d5471486f86cb98608a4a7544
msgid "元素与数值属性选项来自当前数据集。常见磁矩、力、磁力和电荷显示易读名称，分量、模长以及参考值/预测值/误差可直接在性质列表选择。阈值支持负数和科学计数法。修改后会自动预览，仍需通过“应用结果”改变选择集。"
msgstr ""
"Element and numeric property choices come from the current dataset. "
"Common moments, forces, magnetic forces, and charges have readable "
"labels. Components, magnitudes, and reference/prediction/error views can "
"be selected directly from the property list. Thresholds support negative "
"values and scientific notation. Changes automatically preview matches; "
"Apply results is still required to change the selection."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10728
#: 353692524a65425cb16d1f5de8b1a4a1
msgid ""
"原子条件继续使用已有表达式引擎和常用筛选格式，保存后重新打开仍可用控件编辑。切换到“自定义表达式”可以查看和修改生成的条件；包含复杂算术或多字段组合的表达式保留文本编辑方式。缺失字段、无效数值与稀疏原子行的处理仍遵循下文"
" `any/all` 的规则。"
msgstr ""
"Atomic conditions use the existing expression engine and saved-filter "
"format, and reopen as visual controls. Switch to Custom expression to "
"inspect or edit the generated condition. Complex arithmetic and multi-"
"field expressions remain in the text editor. Missing fields, invalid "
"values, and sparse atom rows follow the any/all rules below."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10730
#: 3daba50291c84db4a4e63a4061e968a3
msgid "6.3 保存和复用常用筛选"
msgstr "6.3 Save and reuse filters"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10732
#: 1b8fc32032844e0d89cdf588d38ff76e
msgid "如果经常清理同一类数据，可以保存整个条件组合。例如，一个常用组合可以是："
msgstr ""
"If you repeatedly clean the same kind of data, save the full condition "
"set. For example, a reusable filter might require:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10734
#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11039
#: 35b8e64addfe4a6bb95c9d1db2fc1953 962fa9dfdb49487b93631a94d18feff2
msgid "配置类型包含 `surface`"
msgstr "Configuration type contains `surface`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10735
#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11040
#: 9b3a9271e22e414996345355f796b545 b93adb8186bf44689e6bfca56118b5c4
msgid "必须包含元素 `Fe,O`"
msgstr "Required elements: `Fe,O`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10736
#: be80459bd5ed44a98bb314f82f0c1f7b
msgid "不得包含元素 `H`"
msgstr "Forbidden element: `H`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10737
#: ff9f1efb8cf8445e803bc5ea1c336d70
msgid "条件关系为“满足全部条件（AND）”"
msgstr "Condition relation: `Match all conditions (AND)`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10739
#: 17d947aa39014352a922e75d0e782f99
msgid "保存一次后，下次不需要逐行重填："
msgstr "Once saved, the filter can be reused without re-entering each row:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10741
#: b360422b69954c71ac1b42e9341980b3
msgid "先把条件、AND/OR 关系和 `Aa` 状态设置好。"
msgstr "Set the conditions, AND/OR relation, and `Aa` state."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10742
#: a0fbaa1e33ca4b6e98182aa65b9abf88
msgid "点击“常用筛选 → 保存当前条件…”。"
msgstr "Choose `Saved filters → Save current conditions…`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10743
#: 341c3fa6c07d494db5ff2089fa4d4687
msgid "输入容易识别的名称，例如 `Fe-O surface`，然后点击“保存”。"
msgstr "Enter a recognizable name, such as `Fe-O surface`, then click `Save`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10744
#: 0ae16d810aa7464291a2ccd0b96db9e2
msgid "下次打开编辑器时，点击“常用筛选”，再直接点击该名称。"
msgstr ""
"The next time you open the editor, choose `Saved filters` and click that "
"name."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10746
#: 6fc3f22501e2484d92e4457e2c055d8e
msgid "![常用筛选菜单](../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter_presets.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Saved filters "
"menu](../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter_presets.png)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10746
#: fc005c1b605042269db067b8616c1870
msgid "常用筛选菜单"
msgstr "Saved filters menu"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10746
#: fc005c1b605042269db067b8616c1870
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter_presets.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_structure_filter_presets.png"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10748
#: 6dbe60dc120c4326aa8cc2fe0f349619
msgid "加载常用筛选会**替换编辑器里的当前条件**，随后更新预览；它不会自动执行“应用结果”，也不会改变当前选择。"
msgstr ""
"Loading a saved filter **replaces the conditions currently in the "
"editor** and then updates the preview. It does not run `Apply result` "
"automatically or change the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10750
#: 75633449e6fb45dcb0c6fffee5c399bd
msgid "保存内容包括："
msgstr "A saved filter includes:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10752
#: 562d7f2ec24e466e89f13cae29591311
msgid "每条条件的类型、输入值和启用状态"
msgstr "The type, input value, and enabled state of each condition"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10753
#: 00c6c17662a94accadff2619bef00c25
msgid "配置类型或化学式的匹配方式与 `Aa` 状态"
msgstr ""
"The match mode and `Aa` state for configuration-type and formula "
"conditions"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10754
#: bdeeef9bcf344c0fb9996acbdc767783
msgid "“满足全部条件（AND）”或“满足任一条件（OR）”"
msgstr "`Match all conditions (AND)` or `Match any condition (OR)`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10756
#: c87c6d224dfe4e2c8810e804fe9e4c9b
msgid ""
"常用筛选保存在本机用户配置中，关闭并重新打开软件后仍可使用。它不会保存当前匹配结果、当前选择、数据集路径或 NEP "
"模型；保存的是筛选条件，不是自动处理流程。"
msgstr ""
"Saved filters are stored in the local user configuration and remain "
"available after restarting the application. They do not store current "
"matches, the current selection, a dataset path, or a NEP model; they "
"store filter conditions, not an automated processing workflow."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10758
#: cf3719ed5d234ea898b55e2aae872532
msgid "需要维护已有条目时，进入“常用筛选 → 管理常用筛选”："
msgstr ""
"To maintain existing entries, choose `Saved filters → Manage saved "
"filters`:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10760
#: 6b109bf8579140c486c6255e3860cd8b
msgid "“重命名”只修改名称，不改变条件。"
msgstr "`Rename` changes only the name, not the conditions."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10761
#: 048d70c550b34b7584a486606491210d
msgid "“删除”只删除保存的条目，不清空编辑器中的当前条件。"
msgstr ""
"`Delete` removes only the saved entry; it does not clear the conditions "
"currently in the editor."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10762
#: b9807fd86e8a4ec6aa18f0291b99bc00
