msgstr "First extract the component or norm specified by the suffix"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10907
#: dc0341d09e5e4d9b899a1960602de213
msgid "再在该结构内部做 `max(abs(values))`"
msgstr "Then compute `max(abs(values))` within that structure"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10909
#: d92d0f8c97af4f43b961c235c0a5cb29
msgid ""
"不写 `any/all` 时，以上默认规则保持不变。例如 `atomic.spin.norm < 1` 要求结构内所有原子的磁矩模长都小于 "
"1；磁矩模长为 `[0.5, 2.0]` 的结构不会命中。"
msgstr ""
"Without `any/all`, the default rule is unchanged. For example, "
"`atomic.spin.norm < 1` requires every atom in the structure to have a "
"moment magnitude below 1; a structure with magnitudes `[0.5, 2.0]` does "
"not match."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10911
#: 7d1ca8a312174f36b6aa0bf0bd514ef5
msgid "因此："
msgstr "Therefore:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10913
#: 1aacb3334b1e4a4f8665a5771664754f
msgid "`force.x > 10` 的含义是“这个结构里是否存在原子满足 `max(abs(force_x)) > 10`”"
msgstr ""
"`force.x > 10` asks whether the structure has atoms for which "
"`max(abs(force_x)) > 10`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10914
#: 4eee1eb3105148279af069d321241db5
msgid "`force.norm > 10` 的含义是“这个结构里是否存在原子满足 `max(force_norm) > 10`”"
msgstr ""
"`force.norm > 10` asks whether the structure has atoms for which "
"`max(force_norm) > 10`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10915
#: 7b3ba7fd46864d73b70adcb8d555ee69
