"value rule"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10917
#: e30f01c5adef420c8a58b8d659e5d95d
msgid "结构级字段如 `natoms`、`volume`、`energy` 不需要额外聚合，直接逐结构比较。"
msgstr ""
"Structure-level fields such as `natoms`, `volume`, and `energy` need no "
"additional aggregation and are compared structure by structure."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10919
#: 6e99697ece2644d6acbf19c1a7522f93
msgid "用 `any/all` 显式判断原子条件"
msgstr "Explicit atom predicates with `any/all`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10921
#: 4b819b4299384d40a4611e283eefda22
msgid "`any(atomic.spin.norm < 1)`：至少一个原子的磁矩模长小于 1 即命中。"
msgstr ""
"`any(atomic.spin.norm < 1)`: match if at least one atom has a moment "
"magnitude below 1."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10922
#: 694b81e53fe94ed0a3d2987953e8b017
msgid "`all(atomic.spin.norm < 1)`：所有原子的磁矩模长都小于 1 才命中。"
msgstr ""
"`all(atomic.spin.norm < 1)`: match only if every atom has a moment "
"magnitude below 1."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10923
#: f29c6d906e0d46f09c87b3b639504812
msgid "`any(atomic.charge < 0)`：至少一个原子的电荷为负。"
msgstr ""
"`any(atomic.charge < 0)`: match if at least one atom has a negative "
"charge."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10924
#: 6b249dde3bce4096965c98bd320d225b
msgid "`any(force.ref.norm > 10)`：至少一个原子的参考力模长大于 10。"
msgstr ""
"`any(force.ref.norm > 10)`: match if at least one atom has a reference "
"force magnitude above 10."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10925
#: 22ba2e0dbf5a4f0e923a99d68afec8c8
msgid "`all(force.err.norm < 0.2)`：每个原子的力误差向量模长都小于 0.2。"
msgstr ""
"`all(force.err.norm < 0.2)`: require every atom to have a force error "
"vector magnitude below 0.2."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10926
#: 1c286880b3c6486cb34f8a76b60d0673
msgid "`any(mforce.pred.z < -0.1)`：至少一个原子的预测磁力 z 分量小于 -0.1。"
msgstr ""
"`any(mforce.pred.z < -0.1)`: match if at least one atom has a predicted "
"magnetic force z component below -0.1."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10928
#: 503a19f87f2f48d39d553726cdb86bcc
msgid ""
"适用于当前数据中可用的所有数值型 `atomic.<name>` 属性，以及逐原子的结果字段（如 "
"`force`、`mforce`、`bec`）。支持标量、向量/张量分量和 `.norm`；结果字段继续支持 "
"`.ref/.pred/.err`，`atomic.<name>` "
"仍不支持这三种视图。力与磁力优先使用保留的逐原子数据，不受绘图是否使用结构汇总模式影响。"
msgstr ""
"Supported for all available numeric `atomic.<name>` properties and per-"
"atom result fields such as `force`, `mforce`, and `bec`. Scalars, "
"vector/tensor components, and `.norm` are supported. Result fields retain"
" `.ref/.pred/.err` views; these views remain unsupported for "
"`atomic.<name>`. Force and magnetic force use retained per-atom data when"
" available, independently of structure-summary plotting modes."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10930
#: f9b9647f1317444a896bcfca5df34441
msgid ""
"括号内先逐原子取值、运算和比较，再汇总布尔结果；分量和标量保留正负号，不会隐式取绝对值。例如 `any(atomic.spin.z < -1)` "
"可以筛出含负 z 分量的结构，而默认表达式仍按最大绝对值比较。"
msgstr ""
"Inside the parentheses, values, arithmetic, and comparisons are evaluated"
" per atom before reducing the boolean results. Components and scalars "
"retain their signs without an implicit absolute value. For example, "
"`any(atomic.spin.z < -1)` finds structures containing a negative z "
"component, while unquantified expressions still compare the maximum "
"absolute value."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10932
#: cfd8d768fe914bffafd99bfa83536625
msgid ""
"括号内支持现有比较、算术和逻辑运算。`any(atomic.spin.norm < 1 && force.norm > 10)` "
"要求同一个原子同时满足两个条件；`any(atomic.spin.norm < 1) && any(force.norm > 10)` "
"则允许两个不同原子分别满足。也可以与结构条件组合，例如 `natoms > 100 && any(atomic.spin.norm < 1)`。"
msgstr ""
"Existing comparison, arithmetic, and logical operators are supported "
"inside the parentheses. `any(atomic.spin.norm < 1 && force.norm > 10)` "
"requires the same atom to satisfy both conditions; `any(atomic.spin.norm "
"< 1) && any(force.norm > 10)` allows different atoms to satisfy the two "
"conditions. Structure conditions can also be combined, for example "
"`natoms > 100 && any(atomic.spin.norm < 1)`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10934
#: 0c15fcdc072946e1b2baf81922a39360
msgid ""
"`any/all` 内至少需要一个原子级字段。结构级字段可作为共同条件或阈值参与运算，但 `any(natoms > 100)` 不受支持，直接写"
" `natoms > 100` 即可。"
msgstr ""
"`any/all` requires at least one atomic field. Structure fields can "
"provide shared conditions or thresholds, but `any(natoms > 100)` is "
"unsupported; write `natoms > 100` directly."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10936
#: 15fe03ff7e3547fcaea213a1fb486dfc
msgid ""
"缺少括号内引用字段或该字段没有原子行的结构，`any` 和 `all` 均不命中。引用值为 NaN/Inf 的原子按不满足条件处理：`any` "
"仍可由其他有效原子命中，`all` "
"不会通过。只含部分原子行的结果（如部分磁性原子的磁力）按实际提供的行判断；不能与无法对齐的其他原子字段放在同一个 `any/all` "
"内，遇到这种组合会报错。"
msgstr ""
"Neither `any` nor `all` matches structures with missing referenced fields"
" or no atom rows. Atoms with NaN/Inf reference values are treated as "
"failing the predicate: other valid atoms may still satisfy `any`, but "
"`all` fails. Results containing only some atoms, such as magnetic forces "
"for a subset of magnetic atoms, are evaluated over the supplied rows. "
"Combining them with other atomic fields that cannot be aligned in the "
"same `any/all` raises an error."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10938
#: 713075f2750742b9b8f8e42eb15b2b49
msgid "限定某种元素的原子"
msgstr "Filter atoms of a specific element"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10940
#: c18cb1b70a41414dbf362d49c7d96330
msgid ""
"`atomic.element` 表示当前原子的元素符号，来自结构的原子种类。它只用于 `any/all` 内的 `==`、`!=` "
"比较，元素符号需要加单引号或双引号，并使用标准大小写（例如 `\"Fe\"`、`\"O\"`）。不支持 "
"`.norm`、分量、`.ref/.pred/.err` 或算术运算；自动补全中可以找到 `atomic.element`。"
msgstr ""
"`atomic.element` is the chemical symbol of the current atom, taken from "
"the structure species. Use it only with `==` or `!=` inside `any/all`. "
"Quote symbols with single or double quotes and use standard "
"capitalization, for example `\"Fe\"` or `\"O\"`. Suffixes such as "
"`.norm`, components, `.ref/.pred/.err`, and arithmetic are unsupported. "
"`atomic.element` is included in autocomplete."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10942
#: 8fd860e916c44c8e990edff33986c0b4
msgid ""
"`any(atomic.element == \"Fe\" && atomic.spin.norm < 1)`：存在至少一个磁矩模长小于 1 的 "
"Fe 原子。"
msgstr ""
"`any(atomic.element == \"Fe\" && atomic.spin.norm < 1)`: at least one Fe "
"atom has a moment magnitude below 1."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10943
#: 52a682d62fd641b69e40f08e1482965e
msgid ""
"`has.Fe && all(atomic.element != \"Fe\" || atomic.spin.norm < 1)`：结构含 "
"Fe，且所有 Fe 原子的磁矩模长都小于 1。"
msgstr ""
"`has.Fe && all(atomic.element != \"Fe\" || atomic.spin.norm < 1)`: the "
"structure contains Fe, and every Fe atom has a moment magnitude below 1."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10944
#: 216817edd3464c7c9aa12b1e9d8cbf2b
msgid ""
"`any(atomic.element == \"O\" && force.ref.norm > 10)`：存在至少一个参考力模长大于 10 的 "
"O 原子。"
msgstr ""
"`any(atomic.element == \"O\" && force.ref.norm > 10)`: at least one O "
"atom has a reference force magnitude above 10."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10945
#: a6ce5292aed641598f7167c0d16322e7
msgid "`all(atomic.element == \"Fe\")`：结构内每个原子都是 Fe。"
msgstr "`all(atomic.element == \"Fe\")`: every atom in the structure is Fe."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10947
#: c78f0f31e1f54ca9a43f41399c7e8955
msgid ""
"`all` 仍然判断所有原子，不会把 `atomic.element == \"Fe\"` 自动当作元素范围。因此 "
"`all(atomic.element == \"Fe\" && atomic.spin.norm < 1)` 要求结构全部由 Fe "
"组成，并且每个原子的磁矩模长小于 1。只约束 Fe 时，应使用上面的 `!= \"Fe\" || ...` 写法；加上 `has.Fe` "
"可排除不含 Fe 的结构。"
msgstr ""
"`all` still evaluates every atom; it does not automatically treat "
"`atomic.element == \"Fe\"` as a subset selector. Thus `all(atomic.element"
" == \"Fe\" && atomic.spin.norm < 1)` requires an entirely Fe structure "
"with every moment magnitude below 1. To constrain only Fe atoms, use the "
"`!= \"Fe\" || ...` form above; adding `has.Fe` excludes structures "
"without Fe."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10949
#: bacbeada84174537a649ccb4dc27622a
msgid ""
"`has.Fe && any(atomic.spin.norm < 1)` 仍是两个独立的结构条件，小磁矩可能来自 O 等其他元素。要保证同一个 "
"Fe 原子满足 spin 条件，请将元素比较和 spin 比较放在同一个 `any` 内。"
msgstr ""
"`has.Fe && any(atomic.spin.norm < 1)` remains two separate structure "
"conditions: the small moment could belong to O or another element. Put "
"the element and spin comparisons inside the same `any` to require the "
"same Fe atom to satisfy the spin condition."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:10951
#: c499dbc5314d431cbd7ddb54fcba504d
msgid ""
"合法但数据中不存在的元素比较不会报错，例如 `any(atomic.element == \"Ti\")` 在不含 Ti "
"的结构上为假。缺失字段、NaN/Inf 和原子行对齐仍遵循上面的规则；即使使用元素条件，`all` "
"也不会忽略其他原子上的无效数值。仅含部分磁性原子行、无法与完整元素数组对齐的结果，不能与 `atomic.element` 放在同一个 "
"`any/all` 内。"
msgstr ""
"Valid elements absent from the data do not cause errors: "
"`any(atomic.element == \"Ti\")` is false for structures without Ti. "
"Missing fields, NaN/Inf values, and atom-row alignment follow the rules "
"above. Even with an element condition, `all` does not ignore invalid "
"numeric values on other atoms. Results with only some magnetic-atom rows "
"that cannot be aligned with the full element array cannot be combined "
"with `atomic.element` inside the same `any/all`."

