msgid "6.4.11 在结构筛选器中使用表达式"
msgstr "6.4.11 Using expressions in the structure filter"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11035
#: 9340617bceb94cc0bfa03727d3df9ebc
msgid "添加“自定义表达式”条件后，直接输入完整表达式。表达式仍由原有求值器执行，因此本节列出的字段、运算符和动态数据能力都可以继续使用。"
msgstr ""
"After adding a `Custom expression` condition, enter the complete "
"expression directly. The existing evaluator still executes it, so all "
"fields, operators, and dynamic-data features described in this section "
"remain available."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11037
#: c740d6f82fcf49f98f9be5537a466042
msgid "表达式可以和其他条件组合。例如："
msgstr "An expression can be combined with other conditions. For example:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11041
#: c6a7735ef13248a6a926cc7c9d716b86
msgid "自定义表达式 `natoms >= 64 && force.err.norm < 0.2`"
msgstr "Custom expression: `natoms >= 64 && force.err.norm < 0.2`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:11043
#: 5042c674f99544cdb346299e10b0f998
msgid "三条条件在“满足全部条件”下会取交集。筛选器不会把表达式转换成另一套简化语法，因此不会丢失 `!=`、晶格角、布尔字段或动态字段。"
msgstr ""
"With `Match all conditions`, the three conditions are intersected. The "
"filter does not convert the expression to a separate simplified syntax, "
"so operators such as `!=`, lattice angles, Boolean fields, and dynamic "
"fields are preserved."
